    },
    {
      "block_id": "2102.03334_p1_b5",
      "text": "The pre-train-and-\ufb01ne-tune scheme has been expanded to a\njoint domain of vision and language, giving birth to the cat-\negory of Vision-and-Language Pre-training (VLP) models\n(Lu et al., 2019; Chen et al., 2019; Su et al., 2019; Li et al.,\n2019; Tan & Bansal, 2019; Li et al., 2020a; Lu et al., 2020;\nCho et al., 2020; Qi et al., 2020; Zhou et al., 2020; Huang\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.11,
        559.03,
