    {
      "block_id": "2102.03334_p1_b39",
      "text": "and our proposed ViLT. We have entirely removed convolutional\nneural networks from the VLP pipeline without hurting perfor-\nmance on downstream tasks. ViLT is the \ufb01rst VLP model of which\nthe modal-speci\ufb01c components require less computation than the\ntransformer component for multimodal interactions.\n",
      "bbox": [
        307.44,
        434.52,
        542.93,
        487.36
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
